"The diagram illustrates the process of making leather goods from animal hide.": "",
"Overall, there are eleven steps in this process, beginning with drying the hide and ending with the manufacture of leather products.": "",
"In the first stage of the process, the animal hide is dried in open air.": "",
"After that, it is transported to a factory by lorry for processing.": "",
"Next, the hide is cleaned in lime water and then soaked in lime.": "",
"In the next stage of the process, the hide is sent to a large roller, where it is flattened.": "",
"Following this, the flattened hide is soaked in tannin, a mixture of vegetable matter and water.": "",
"Then, it goes through a polishing stage, in which smaller rollers are used.": "",
"Finally, the leather is transported to a different factory, where it is manufactured into various products, such as shoes, handbags, and sports equipment.": "",
